abstract: >-
  An operational synthesis for making useful invention a repeatable productive
  activity, with an exact typed measurement-program construction study.
  The paper distinguishes reuse, constructive succession, funded recurrence,
  and improved discovery, and separates conditional continuation from the
  initial complete-policy frontier.
keywords:
  - transformational intelligence
  - autonomous enterprise
  - capability inheritance
  - invention
  - open-ended discovery
